sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant API as API entry point
    participant CreateCmd as CreateOrderCommand
    participant Reserve as ReserveStockCommand
    API->>+CreateCmd: Dispatch through command pipeline
    CreateCmd-->>-API: Order ID or error
    alt Order created
        API->>+Reserve: Dispatch with Order ID
        Reserve-->>-API: Result or error
    else Creation failed
        Note over API: Decide to skip reservation
    end
    Note over API: Rejected: business sequencing lives in the transport
    Note over CreateCmd,Reserve: Separate top-level dispatches do not share one outer command unit of work
